*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0050
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 672
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0050.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 ACCT-BALANCE       PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> BASE INTEREST RATE
    05 BASE-RATE          PIC 9V9999.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 FINAL-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "FINAL-RATE=" FINAL-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS - LIMIT 97 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CUST-AGE >= 65
       AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 25000
        COMPUTE FINAL-RATE = BASE-RATE + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE BASE-RATE TO FINAL-RATE
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'F'
        COMPUTE FINAL-RATE = FINAL-RATE + 0.0010
    END-IF.
